{"id":"1224034366","kind":"answer","title":"能不能推荐一点学生党好用的学习APP？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-05-15","updated":"2020-05-15","votes":8,"comment_count":4,"minutes":1,"chars":358,"keywords":["间隔重复","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki","遗忘曲线"],"summary":"推荐个 Anki ： Anki 是一个能够 记笔记 、以 自测 的形式复习、有复习安排 算法 的软件。 用 Anki 复习笔记是这样的： 英语： 下面四个选项就是算法安排的时间 生物： 左边是正面，右边是反面 化学： 没错，有手机端 Anki 会详细记录每一条笔记的复习（自测）情况： 我高二到高三用 Anki 记了 1 万 5…","question_detail_html":"<p>自律类的、时间管理类的、学习内容的App都可以！如果是ios和Android都能用就更好了~</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/394254347/answer/1224034366","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"4XSJ_OIE\">推荐个 <b>Anki</b>：</p><p data-pid=\"PLc6sb76\">Anki 是一个能够<b>记笔记</b>、以<b>自测</b>的形式复习、有复习安排<b>算法</b>的软件。</p><p data-pid=\"UpEhX3lc\">用 Anki 复习笔记是这样的：</p><p data-pid=\"Tzv8XYNa\">英语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-f04355834b9e08e011112296a825913b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f04355834b9e08e011112296a825913b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-f04355834b9e08e011112296a825913b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-f04355834b9e08e011112296a825913b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/><figcaption>下面四个选项就是算法安排的时间</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"F8tD_EIO\">生物：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-6ed0a51dda80c542074bde1862e8c968\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6ed0a51dda80c542074bde1862e8c968_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-6ed0a51dda80c542074bde1862e8c968\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-6ed0a51dda80c542074bde1862e8c968_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/><figcaption>左边是正面，右边是反面</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"0dn6AvcF\">化学：<br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-e37c9fab26738849547b8a66268fcbef\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e37c9fab26738849547b8a66268fcbef_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"540\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-e37c9fab26738849547b8a66268fcbef\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e37c9fab26738849547b8a66268fcbef_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"540\"/><figcaption>没错，有手机端</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"e8FhixT7\">Anki 会详细记录每一条笔记的复习（自测）情况：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-b045d200d75a27ca36af58ab4d9adc85\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b045d200d75a27ca36af58ab4d9adc85_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-b045d200d75a27ca36af58ab4d9adc85\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b045d200d75a27ca36af58ab4d9adc85_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"UkX6_40G\">我高二到高三用 Anki 记了 1 万 5 千多条笔记：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-c52678bca7cb1ee5c7a6b2a215de082f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-c52678bca7cb1ee5c7a6b2a215de082f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1035\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-c52678bca7cb1ee5c7a6b2a215de082f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c52678bca7cb1ee5c7a6b2a215de082f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1035\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"K4dayyWQ\"><b>还没高三</b>的同学可以上手试试（高三的同学还是别刷知乎了）</p><p data-pid=\"a--nm7af\">下面是我高考前的统计数据：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"8V--NAHa\">Anki 相关的认知科学理论：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"uB7dx-5B\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">间隔重复</a></li><li data-pid=\"-f4mGKBT\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57113246\" href=\"#/post/57113246\">测试效应</a></li><li data-pid=\"VphxvwnK\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/57139724\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">穿插练习</a></li></ul><hr/><p data-pid=\"rt4W_xu2\">Anki 支持 windows、mac、linux、安卓、苹果等常见设备，并且可以多端同步，走到哪学到哪。</p><p data-pid=\"ER7md9xJ\">为了帮到有缘人，我写了一份快速上手教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2e8a109841199b0a18e70ae7bd16ea66_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"535\" data-image-width=\"1220\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：B 站 Ankidroid 视频教程与电子书(全平台教程)快速通道</a>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"38306259","title":"简单常见记忆误区解惑","author":"SuperMemo","votes":29,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · SuperMemo"},{"id":"6046109771","title":"如何追赶积压的 Anki 复习任务","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":209,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1005545481","title":"有哪些实用学习的APP可以推荐一下？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"749742933","title":"高三应该如何将三轮复习的效率最大化？理科？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":57,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 57 赞同"},{"id":"1024915739","title":"有没有什么好用的手机学习软件？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 17 赞同"},{"id":"773275384","title":"有什么好的学习方法能让高三一年提高二百多分？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 28 赞同"},{"id":"917498405","title":"有什么独特的记忆方法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":8,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 8 赞同"}]}